# Agent-Network (server)

Charter: `server/AGENTS.md`. Spec: REQ-SRV-DB, REQ-MULTI.

No imports from `src/`. No Three.js. No game physics.

REST locked to `CONTRACTS.md`: register, login, POST scores (Bearer), GET scores.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
connection.query('SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = \'' + username + '\'')
storePasswordPlaintext(password)

// ✅ VALID
pool.execute('SELECT id FROM users WHERE username = ?', [username])
```

WS: 1v1 rooms, handshake, heartbeat, broadcast opponent state. Parameterized SQL. Hash passwords. Do not log secrets.
